1320565.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府、市直各单位：\n　　为认真贯彻落实《福建省促进政务新媒体健康有序发展七条措施》，进一步加强我市政务新媒体建设，促进政务新媒体健康有序发展，现将有关工作要求通知如下。\n　　一、明", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/t20190730_1320565.htm", "docreltime": "2019.07.30 18:05:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于促进政务新媒体健康有序发展的工作要求", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1392056, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/t20190730_1320565.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1319257, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "有关文件", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/t20190725_1319257.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的十九大精神，落细落实意识形态工作责任制，建好管好用好政务新媒体，促进政府职能转变、建设服务型政府，营造有利于创新创业创造的良好发展环境，根据《国务院", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/t20190725_1319257.htm", "docreltime": "2019.07.04 16:17:00", "doctitle": "福建省促进政务新媒体健康有序发展七条措施", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1390548, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/t20190725_1319257.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201907/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1308299, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "有关文件", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkzd/smszdwj/201906/t20190618_1308299.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各部门：\n　　根据国务院办公厅、省政府办公厅有关文件精神，我们研究制定了《三明市2019年政务公开工作主要任务》，现印发给你们，请按各自职责认真抓好落实，落实情况纳入政府信", "docabstract": "2019年政务公开工作主要任务", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkzd/smszdwj/201906/t20190618_1308299.htm", "docreltime": "2019.06.18 11:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市2019年政务公开工作主要任务的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1399447, "sourcename": "三明市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkzd/smszdwj/201906/t20190618_1308299.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkzd/smszdwj/201906/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1283456, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "有关文件", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201904/t20190419_1283456.htm", "content": "\n　　各省、自治区、直辖市人民政府办公厅，国务院各部委、各直属机构办公厅（室）：\n　　为进一步推动全国政府网站和政府系统政务新媒体健康有序发展，国务院办公厅制定了《政府网站与政务新媒体检查指标》和《政府", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201904/t20190419_1283456.htm", "docreltime": "2019.04.19 08:33:00", "doctitle": "国务院办公厅秘书局关于印发政府网站与政务新媒体检查指标、监管工作年度考核指标的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1351964, "sourcename": "中国政府网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201904/t20190419_1283456.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201904/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1272886, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "有关文件", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201903/t20190314_1272886.htm", "content": "\n　　各省、自治区、直辖市人民政府，国务院各部委、各直属机构：\n　　政务新媒体是移动互联网时代党和政府联系群众、服务群众、凝聚群众的重要渠道，是加快转变政府职能、建设服务型政府的重要手段，是引导网上舆论", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/wzjs/wgwj/201903/t20190314_1272886.htm", "docreltime": "2018.12.28 15:57:00", "doctitle": "国务院办公厅关于推进政务新媒体健康有序发展的意见", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1340100, "sourcename"